              {
                "title": "",
                "text": "What does white smoke from exhaust mean- + White smoke can be normal condensation (thin, clears quickly) or a serious problem (thick, sweet smell). Thick white smoke means coolant burning - head gasket failure (£550-£1,200) or cracked head (£1,200-£2,500). Stop driving immediately.",
